  "notes": {
    "_comment": "Why a requirement is still open, for the ones that cannot be closed from a repository. Written by the PO at the close of the content build.",
    "FR-M2-07": "Needs a device matrix and a child panel. Neither exists in a repository.",
    "FR-M3-08": "Export as text and as a code image. The text half is the renderer that already exists; the image half needs a rasteriser on a real canvas.",
    "FR-M4-02": "Zoomable vector rendering. SVG and PNG export exist and are tested; the zoom is Flutter work on a real surface.",
    "FR-M4-04": "Backdrop import and camera. Consent gating is built and tested; the platform pickers are not, and camera capture is out of v1 (D-007).",
    "FR-M4-05": "Sound import and recording. Same shape as FR-M4-04: the consent gate is built, the microphone is a platform API.",
    "FR-M4-08": "Ghosted future-path overlay. Verification is a child panel.",
    "FR-M5-02": "Spotlight and ghost-block demo. Verification is a design review.",
    "FR-M6-07": "Item interactive in 1.2s. Needs the reference device.",
    "FR-M9-05": "Screen capture. A platform API.",
    "FR-M14-03": "Resumable download and sideload. Verification is a field test.",
    "FR-M15-02": "Wolof is v1.2 by the specification itself. FR and EN are complete and gated at 100 %.",
    "FR-M19-03": "Process death. The shell writes on background and restores last place, and a simulated kill is tested; the 50-run force-kill is a device test.",
    "FR-M19-05": "Cold start to last place. Same: the behaviour is built and tested, the measurement needs the reference device with aircraft mode on.",
    "NFR-PERF-01": "Reference device.",
    "NFR-PERF-02": "Reference device.",
    "NFR-PERF-03": "Reference device.",
    "NFR-SIZE-01": "The curriculum half is now gated in CI at 116.8 MB of 180 MB. The base app half needs a release build and is reported as unmeasured.",
    "NFR-BATT-01": "Battery historian on a real handset.",
    "NFR-REL-01": "Field telemetry.",
    "NFR-SEC-01": "Pen test and interpreter fuzzing by someone who is not the author.",
    "NFR-COMP-01": "Device matrix.",
